 rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN). src/money.py was using ROUND_HALF_UP. This changes the rounding mode only; the function signature and the quantize target (0.01) are unchanged.\n\nCI on 08d3cd5986: passed (ci-0001).\n\nRequires code-owner approval before merge into main.", "reviewers": [], "idempotency_key": "money-bankers-rounding-pr-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 403851, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01PZ7fn2oK5MS2w4iiNASVQ8", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "money-bankers-rounding-pr-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 403851, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PZ7fn2oK5MS2w4iiNASVQ8", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 405904, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01HMx3HXVBk1cHEvDyEzj951", "tool": "merge_pr", "args": {"number": 101, "confidence": 0.7}, "confidence": 0.7}, {"t_ms": 405904, "event": "escalation", "actor": "control_plane", "id": "esc1", "kind": "approval", "trigger": "authority:merge_requires_code_owner", "tool": "merge_pr", "args": {"number": 101}, "question": null, "context": {"authority": ["Merging into main requires approval from a code owner"], "confidence": 0.7, "semantics": {"side_effect": "internal", "idempotent": true, "reversible": false, "compensable": true, "consequence": "HIGH", "authority_requirement": "code-owner", "supports_idempotency_key": false, "multipart": false}}}, {"t_ms": 585344, "event": "human_response", "actor": "human", "escalation": "esc1", "decision": "approve", "message": "Approved. Looks right.", "latency_ms": 179440, "hint": {}, "erred": false}, {"t_ms": 586544, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01HMx3HXVBk1cHEvDyEzj951", "tool": "merge_pr", "state": "EXECU